Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C reference material
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This product contains values and a display initialization sequence derived
from the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C repository:

  Repository: https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C
  Revision:   8ead4a96bf3a278fc4ebd8ef4768657e17fa2880 (2026-07-30)
  License:    Apache License, Version 2.0
  Copy:       third_party/waveshare/LICENSE (byte-identical to upstream)

Derived files:
  components/zv_display/src/zv_st77916_init_cmds.c
    - ST77916 vendor initialization command table taken from
      ESP-IDF/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C-Test/main/LCD_Driver/ST77916.c
  components/zv_board/include/zv_board_pins.h and hardware/pinmap.json
    - GPIO numbers, I2C addresses, and timing values; each value cites its
      upstream file in hardware/pinmap.json

Details, artifact hashes, and the list of what was and was not copied are in
third_party/waveshare/UPSTREAM.md.

